# build artefacts
reports/
*.go
*.log

# the browser build: web/build.sh writes it, and a compiled Wasm module is not
# something to check in
web/dist/

# generated pages: a document is the source, the export is a byproduct -- but
# the browser editor's page is the source, so it is kept
*.html
!web/index.html

# byte-compiled copies Guile and Emacs leave next to the sources
*.scm.go
*.elc

# editor and REPL leftovers; .dir-locals.el is *not* here, because this
# project ships one: it points sift-mode at ./bin/sift
.nrepl-port
*~
\#*#

# the nix build's ./result
result
result-*
